@startuml seq-20-protection-stats-sparkline
title Rate Limiting — Stats Poll + Allow/Block Sparkline

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
autonumber

actor "Security Analyst\n(Angular)" as SA
participant "Gateway\n:9000" as GW
participant "Rate Limiting\nService :9004" as RL
participant "TokenBucket\nService" as TBS
participant "Redis :6379" as Redis

== Initial load (startWith(0) + interval 5s) ==

SA -> GW : GET /api/protection/stats?topN=10\nBearer JWT (PERM_roaming-events:read)
GW -> RL : lb://rate-limiting-service

RL -> TBS : allowedCount()
TBS -> Redis : GET rl:stats:allowed
Redis --> TBS : "1248"
TBS -> Redis : GET rl:stats:blocked
Redis --> TBS : "37"
TBS -> Redis : ZREVRANGEBYSCORE rl:stats:blocked:keys +inf -inf WITHSCORES LIMIT 0 10
Redis --> TBS : [("imsi:234-15-000123", 24.0), ("ip:10.0.0.5", 8.0), …]

RL -> RL : rate = 37/(1248+37)*100 = 2.88%\npolicyCount = policies.count()
RL --> SA : 200 { allowed:1248, blocked:37, blockRatePct:2.88,\n  policyCount:4,\n  topBlocked:[{key:"imsi:234-15-000123",blocks:24},…] }

note over SA : Angular history.update:\n  push {ts:Date.now(), allowed:1248, blocked:37}\n  slice to last 20 points

== 5 seconds later ==

SA -> GW : GET /api/protection/stats?topN=10 (interval tick)
GW -> RL : route
RL -> TBS : allowedCount() → "1265"  blocked() → "38"
RL --> SA : 200 { allowed:1265, blocked:38, … }

note over SA : history now has 2 points\nsparkData.allowed = [1265-1248] = [17]\nsparkData.blocked = [38-37] = [1]\nsparkPath renders SVG polyline

== policyBlocks computed (client-side aggregation) ==

note over SA : policyBlocks = computed from topBlocked:\n  split "imsi:234-15-000123".split(":")[0] = "imsi"\n  map.set("imsi", 24)\n  split "ip:10.0.0.5" → "ip" → map.set("ip", 8)\n\nPolicies table "Blocks" column shows:\n  imsi → 24\n  ip → 8\n  default, operator → 0 (not in top-10)

@enduml
